SUMMARY:Model Mondays - Spotlight on Hugging Face & Managed Compute
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nHugging Face expands the range of o
 pen models developers can discover\, while Managed Compute provides the in
 frastructure needed to deploy and run selected models for real-time infere
 nce.\n\nJoin us as we explore this workflow in Microsoft Foundry and see h
 ow an open model can move from the catalog into a working AI agent.\n---\n
 \n* Explore the Resource https://github.com/microsoft/model-mondays\n* Rea
 d the Newsletter https://aka.ms/model-mondays/newsletter\n* Continue the c
 onversation on the Discord https://aka.ms/model-mondays/discord\n\n[event 
 ID:27566]
