SUMMARY:Build AI-powered soccer insights apps with cloud-native Azure Data
 bases
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nLearn how to build and deploy AI-po
 wered applications that analyze football match and player data using cloud
 -native Azure Databases.\n\nUsing Premier League-inspired scenarios such a
 s identifying team play styles\, analyzing counterattacks\, or uncovering 
 player performance patterns\, we'll walk through a reference architecture 
 that pairs operational data in Azure SQL\, PostgreSQL\, and Cosmos DB with
  vector search and retrieval to ground your models in real match data.\n\n
 Attendees will leave with practical guidance and ideas they can extend int
 o their hackathon projects.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3163
 71493/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260901T161557Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260901T161557Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
